111
00:03:17,144 --> 00:03:18,984
Phi? I'm coming in.

112
00:03:20,144 --> 00:03:22,814
Huh? Are you well enough to be up?

113
00:03:22,814 --> 00:03:24,774
Yeah. I'm all right.

114
00:03:25,484 --> 00:03:27,864
I'll be taking part in the ruin exploration too.

115
00:03:27,864 --> 00:03:29,904
What? You shouldn't push yourself so hard.

116
00:03:30,654 --> 00:03:33,324
Headmistress Relie told me
 that you collapsed yesterday.

117
00:03:33,324 --> 00:03:36,534
Thank you for worrying about me, Lu.

118
00:03:38,494 --> 00:03:39,914
So this is where you were!

119
00:03:39,914 --> 00:03:42,674
Lux, I have something I need to tell you.

120
00:03:42,674 --> 00:03:43,424
Come with me.

121
00:03:43,424 --> 00:03:44,504
Oh, okay.

122
00:03:47,844 --> 00:03:49,884
All right. Did you get all that?

123
00:03:49,884 --> 00:03:53,684
Yes. And I can use new functions with this?

124
00:03:53,684 --> 00:04:00,814
Correct. What I just taught you removes the limiter that Drag-Knights normally have.

125
00:04:00,814 --> 00:04:03,144
It's called Over Limit.

126
00:04:03,524 --> 00:04:05,524
Over Limit?

127
00:04:05,524 --> 00:04:08,864
If you input the limiter removal code,
 you'll be able to use it,

128
00:04:08,864 --> 00:04:10,404
but don't think of trying it out yet!

129
00:04:10,944 --> 00:04:11,944
It could kill you!

130
00:04:12,534 --> 00:04:13,784
Then why did you tell me?!

131
00:04:14,324 --> 00:04:17,284
It's in case another Ragnarok appears.

132
00:04:17,284 --> 00:04:19,164
Better to know it and not need it.

133
00:04:19,164 --> 00:04:24,624
Well, you already defeated the Ragnarok of the ruin
 we're exploring tomorrow, so no need to worry.

134
00:04:25,714 --> 00:04:28,674
Lux, I have a bad feeling about this.

135
00:04:28,674 --> 00:04:30,174
Give me a break!

136
00:04:34,844 --> 00:04:36,844
Everyone's here, so let's begin.

137
00:04:37,304 --> 00:04:40,434
Now that the gatekeeper Ragnarok has been defeated,

138
00:04:40,434 --> 00:04:44,604
the door to the deepest level
 of the ruin may have opened.

139
00:04:44,604 --> 00:04:49,324
Because the area to explore is vast,
 Airi and I will also participate.

140
00:04:49,324 --> 00:04:50,114
Huh?

141
00:04:50,114 --> 00:04:51,484
Even you, Headmistress?

142
00:04:51,484 --> 00:04:54,404
Airi, explain how to enter this ruin.

143
00:04:54,404 --> 00:04:55,034
Yes, ma'am.

144
00:04:55,784 --> 00:04:57,454
According to reports from 
previous expeditions,

145
00:04:57,454 --> 00:05:01,044
if you stand inside the circle of ancient glyphs in the center part of the ruin,

146
00:05:01,044 --> 00:05:05,874
after a certain period of time, you will be enveloped in light and transported inside.

147
00:05:06,254 --> 00:05:08,464
How are you feeling, Phi?

148
00:05:08,464 --> 00:05:10,094
I'm fine.

149
00:05:10,554 --> 00:05:14,174
Okay. But if you feel any pain,
 tell me right away.

150
00:05:14,594 --> 00:05:17,264
Sure thing. You're so kind, Lu.

151
00:05:17,264 --> 00:05:22,274
All right, kind brother of mine,
 I'll be relying on you for transportation.

152
00:05:22,274 --> 00:05:26,734
Of course. But why didn't you tell me you'd be coming too?

153
00:05:27,194 --> 00:05:29,314
Make sure to protect me.

154
00:05:37,324 --> 00:05:39,074
So this is the entrance.

155
00:05:40,074 --> 00:05:43,044
Philuffy. You haven't ridden a Machine Dragon in a while.

156
00:05:43,044 --> 00:05:45,544
How is it? Not too tiring?

157
00:05:45,544 --> 00:05:48,254
It's not. I'm fine, Relie.

158
00:05:53,174 --> 00:05:54,764
Everyone, prepare yourselves!

159
00:06:08,484 --> 00:06:09,984
Noct, can you tell us anything?

160
00:06:09,984 --> 00:06:14,694
Yes. Please wait while I
 scan for Abyss life signs.

161
00:06:15,694 --> 00:06:17,534
This place is pretty degraded.

162
00:06:17,534 --> 00:06:18,454
Yes.

163
00:06:18,454 --> 00:06:23,784
According to the documents, the inner part
 of this ruin starts at the eleventh level.

164
00:06:23,784 --> 00:06:26,504
We are currently on the first level.

165
00:06:26,954 --> 00:06:29,464
Let's start exploring then.

166
00:06:33,214 --> 00:06:35,214
We've entered the second level.

167
00:06:35,214 --> 00:06:41,434
Remain vigilant, everyone. We don't know what pile of debris might hide an Abyss or a trap.

168
00:06:44,104 --> 00:06:45,604
Everyone, please stop!

169
00:06:52,444 --> 00:06:54,074
What is this place?

170
00:06:54,074 --> 00:06:56,944
This is called the biome sphere.

171
00:06:56,944 --> 00:07:01,614
It sustains an ecosystem
 similar to a natural forest.

172
00:07:02,164 --> 00:07:05,534
It seems it was the scene of a fierce battle.

173
00:07:05,534 --> 00:07:10,674
And it appears none of the ruin's facilities 
maintaining this ecosystem are currently shut down.

174
00:07:10,674 --> 00:07:13,384
Noct, do you detect any enemies in the vicinity?

175
00:07:13,714 --> 00:07:20,094
No. I've kept my search radius to a maximum, but I still haven't detected any Abysses.

176
00:07:20,634 --> 00:07:25,054
Then let's split up into teams
 to cover more ground.

177
00:07:25,854 --> 00:07:29,184
Krulcifer's team will take level four.

178
00:07:29,184 --> 00:07:31,944
Tillfur's team will take level five.

179
00:07:32,404 --> 00:07:34,814
Lux's team will take level six.

180
00:07:34,814 --> 00:07:38,404
Then I guess I'm on level six with Lux, right?

181
00:07:38,404 --> 00:07:42,364
No. You're assigned to level three, Celis.

182
00:07:42,364 --> 00:07:43,914
You'll be fine by yourself, right?

183
00:07:44,624 --> 00:07:47,874
By myself? A-All right.

184
00:07:49,334 --> 00:07:52,004
I'm exploring alone again.

185
00:07:52,004 --> 00:07:54,544
Why does this always happen?

186
00:07:54,544 --> 00:08:00,094
We have a lot of ground to cover, and it's natural for
 an experienced person like me to go solo, but still...

187
00:08:00,884 --> 00:08:05,804
If you want to, you could join my team later, Celis.

188
00:08:06,224 --> 00:08:07,934
A-Are you sure?

189
00:08:07,934 --> 00:08:08,974
Yes.

190
00:08:08,974 --> 00:08:11,024
You're welcome to join when we meet up.

191
00:08:11,684 --> 00:08:13,444
Thank you!

192
00:08:13,444 --> 00:08:16,694
You're such a reliable boy, Lux!

193
00:08:17,234 --> 00:08:20,364
Come on, everyone! Let's have fun exploring!

194
00:08:20,944 --> 00:08:24,994
First time I've seen Celis so happy about a mission.

195
00:08:24,994 --> 00:08:27,244
Luxy is such a bad boy.

196
00:08:32,414 --> 00:08:33,414
This must be the way.

197
00:08:34,374 --> 00:08:40,384
Lux! Don't make any advances on my roommate
 just because no one else is around.

198
00:08:40,384 --> 00:08:44,634
You say that as if I'm trying 
to seduce every girl.

199
00:08:44,634 --> 00:08:46,724
Your concern is unfounded.

200
00:08:46,724 --> 00:08:51,104
Lux doesn't even see me as a girl.

201
00:08:51,104 --> 00:08:51,434
Huh?

202
00:08:51,434 --> 00:08:53,934
It's mildly depressing, but oh well.

203
00:08:53,934 --> 00:08:55,604
Th-That's not true.

204
00:08:55,604 --> 00:08:57,774
I think you're very cute, Noct.

205
00:08:57,774 --> 00:08:59,064
You do?

206
00:08:59,064 --> 00:09:02,284
So what in particular do you find charming about me?

207
00:09:02,284 --> 00:09:04,824
Huh? Well... Um...

208
00:09:05,324 --> 00:09:08,704
Starting from the collarbones down your chest line...

209
00:09:10,034 --> 00:09:11,374
I see.

210
00:09:11,374 --> 00:09:13,914
So that's where you're usually looking.

211
00:09:18,134 --> 00:09:18,964
Stop!

212
00:09:21,254 --> 00:09:25,974
It's not an Abyss, but under the debris a hundred meters ahead,

213
00:09:25,974 --> 00:09:28,474
there is something shaped like a human.

214
00:09:28,474 --> 00:09:30,514
Understood. I'll go check it out.

215
00:09:48,034 --> 00:09:48,954
What was it?

216
00:09:49,874 --> 00:09:50,664
That's...

217
00:09:59,254 --> 00:10:02,674
You said you found something interesting. What is it?

218
00:10:03,554 --> 00:10:06,474
What's this? I mean, who is she?

219
00:10:06,474 --> 00:10:08,184
We don't know.

220
00:10:08,184 --> 00:10:14,684
But I thought you may be able to make something of this, since you've seen other ruins.

221
00:10:15,854 --> 00:10:17,644
Krulcifer?

222
00:10:17,644 --> 00:10:18,604
This is dangerous.

223
00:10:18,604 --> 00:10:19,654
Huh?

224
00:10:19,654 --> 00:10:23,154
Could you please go join up with your princess's team?

225
00:10:24,074 --> 00:10:27,324
If you stay here, you might get hurt.

226
00:10:27,324 --> 00:10:29,244
Leave this to us.

227
00:10:29,994 --> 00:10:32,414
We'll investigate the girl.

228
00:10:32,414 --> 00:10:35,084
If a fight breaks out, it would be difficult to protect you.

229
00:10:35,834 --> 00:10:37,044
All right.

230
00:10:37,044 --> 00:10:37,964
Be careful.

231
00:10:42,794 --> 00:10:45,214
This girl... isn't human.

232
00:10:46,134 --> 00:10:48,474
She's not an Abyss either, of course.

233
00:10:48,474 --> 00:10:51,474
I can't think of an appropriate word to describe her.

234
00:10:59,444 --> 00:11:02,614
Presence of supervisor life form acknowledged.

235
00:11:02,614 --> 00:11:04,444
Reactivating systems.

236
00:11:14,494 --> 00:11:17,914
Forgive me. It seems you
 didn't intend to summon me.

237
00:11:17,914 --> 00:11:20,044
Clink. Good night.

238
00:11:20,044 --> 00:11:20,504
What?!

239
00:11:20,504 --> 00:11:22,884
H-Hey! Why are you lying back down?

240
00:11:22,884 --> 00:11:25,844
I-I wouldn't want you to misunderstand.

241
00:11:25,844 --> 00:11:29,134
I have no memory of the disaster that took place.

242
00:11:29,764 --> 00:11:34,144
If possible, I'd like to be reprogrammed
 rather than disposed of.

243
00:11:34,144 --> 00:11:37,064
And now she's started
 shifting blame all of a sudden.

244
00:11:37,064 --> 00:11:41,604
Wait, do you not know who I am, Supervisor?

245
00:11:41,604 --> 00:11:42,944
Supervisor?

246
00:11:42,944 --> 00:11:44,484
What are you talking about?

247
00:11:44,484 --> 00:11:46,774
More importantly, what are you?

248
00:11:46,774 --> 00:11:47,574
What's your name?

249
00:11:50,444 --> 00:11:52,364
Sorry for the late introduction.

250
00:11:52,364 --> 00:11:54,414
My name is La Krulshe.

251
00:11:54,414 --> 00:11:56,034
I'm the manager of this ruin.

252
00:11:57,034 --> 00:12:00,834
I'm an anthropomorphic interface
 to the systems managing this facility.

253
00:12:00,834 --> 00:12:03,254
Hopefully, that explanation was comprehensible.

254
00:12:03,674 --> 00:12:07,294
I am what is called an automaton.

255
00:12:07,294 --> 00:12:10,014
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

256
00:12:14,844 --> 00:12:16,684
So, well...

257
00:12:17,354 --> 00:12:20,644
Does that mean that you know
 everything about the previous era?

258
00:12:22,694 --> 00:12:26,654
Unfortunately, there is some bad news
 regarding my records of the past.

259
00:12:28,734 --> 00:12:31,864
I overslept and completely forget them. Sorry.

260
00:12:32,284 --> 00:12:33,324
Huh?

261
00:12:36,034 --> 00:12:38,784
P-Please don't look at me like that!

262
00:12:38,784 --> 00:12:44,714
It seems that due to an unknown incident,
 I have temporarily completely lost that data.

263
00:12:44,714 --> 00:12:47,334
Please don't scrap me!

264
00:12:47,334 --> 00:12:49,634
I have no intention of doing that.

265
00:12:49,964 --> 00:12:51,304
Thank goodness.

266
00:12:51,304 --> 00:12:54,634
You have been acknowledged as a supervisor.

267
00:12:54,634 --> 00:12:58,854
I shall obey your will and orders.

268
00:12:58,854 --> 00:12:59,354
However...

269
00:12:59,724 --> 00:13:00,854
However?

270
00:13:00,854 --> 00:13:02,474
As long as my master unit is functional,

271
00:13:02,474 --> 00:13:08,024
in a moment's notice, I could connect to the core system and supplement my memory, but...

272
00:13:08,024 --> 00:13:10,194
I can imagine what the problem is.

273
00:13:10,774 --> 00:13:14,744
Most of the facilities of this ruin
 are probably shut down currently.

274
00:13:14,744 --> 00:13:15,614
That's correct!

275
00:13:15,614 --> 00:13:17,664
I'd expect no less from a supervisor!

276
00:13:17,664 --> 00:13:21,914
You are as wise as you are beautiful!

277
00:13:21,914 --> 00:13:23,544
No need to brown-nose.

278
00:13:23,544 --> 00:13:27,004
So how do we reactivate this core system?

279
00:13:27,004 --> 00:13:32,674
You can do it by giving a reactivate command in
 the supervisor area on the lowest level of this ruin.

280
00:13:32,674 --> 00:13:35,054
We should tell the others.

281
00:13:35,054 --> 00:13:35,724
Yes.

282
00:13:41,764 --> 00:13:45,434
I'm honored to meet so many people!

283
00:13:45,434 --> 00:13:47,274
She's so small and cute!

284
00:13:47,274 --> 00:13:49,274
Just like a doll.

285
00:13:50,194 --> 00:13:51,774
What is that?

286
00:13:51,774 --> 00:13:53,984
Is it a person?

287
00:13:53,984 --> 00:13:59,914
No, it looks like a girl, but it's definitely a doll
 created with the technology of the previous era.

288
00:14:02,874 --> 00:14:03,704
Phi?

289
00:14:04,374 --> 00:14:06,374
May I talk to you for a moment?

290
00:14:06,374 --> 00:14:07,664
Yes, of course.

291
00:14:07,664 --> 00:14:10,674
I'm concerned about something La Krulshe said.

292
00:14:11,094 --> 00:14:17,424
Apparently I'm one of the supervisors,
 but there are beings called creators above them.

293
00:14:17,424 --> 00:14:18,514
Creators?

294
00:14:19,014 --> 00:14:22,604
Yes. They are a higher authority than me.

295
00:14:23,934 --> 00:14:26,144
Let's hurry forward.

296
00:14:26,144 --> 00:14:27,434
Airi, tell us what lies ahead.

297
00:14:27,434 --> 00:14:33,154
Yes, ma'am. Level seven ahead is called the production area.

298
00:14:33,154 --> 00:14:36,284
All teams, start exploring in three directions.

299
00:14:37,324 --> 00:14:39,824
Phi. This is too much strain for you.

300
00:14:39,824 --> 00:14:42,784
Don't worry. I'm still all right.

301
00:14:42,784 --> 00:14:47,124
Fine, but stay with me from now on, okay?

302
00:14:47,124 --> 00:14:47,874
Okay.

303
00:14:51,214 --> 00:14:54,174
Royal Capital, Castle Atismata

304
00:14:51,214 --> 00:14:54,174
Royal Capital, Castle Atismata

305
00:14:57,094 --> 00:15:01,894
So how do you intend to deal
 with the man who escaped prison,

306
00:15:01,894 --> 00:15:04,974
and is now planning to attack us
 with the rebel army?

307
00:15:05,684 --> 00:15:07,474
You mean Ragreed?

308
00:15:08,144 --> 00:15:11,564
I can't send many troops to the royal capital.

309
00:15:11,564 --> 00:15:14,734
Good Drag-Knights are in short supply everywhere.

310
00:15:14,734 --> 00:15:19,654
In that case, how about we
 use the Academy's students?

311
00:15:21,284 --> 00:15:24,874
Your daughter, Miss Celis,
 is among them after all.

312
00:15:24,874 --> 00:15:26,294
That is not funny.

313
00:15:26,294 --> 00:15:30,334
We can't throw students in the fray.
 They'd be slaughtered.

314
00:15:30,334 --> 00:15:37,464
I hear there is a Drag-Knight of great skill in the
 Academy's knight squadron. He defeated the Ragnarok.

315
00:15:37,924 --> 00:15:40,924
If I recall correctly, his name is Lux Arcadia.

316
00:15:41,474 --> 00:15:46,184
Moreover, it seems Princess Lisesharte is quite friendly with him as well.

317
00:15:46,184 --> 00:15:47,354
She is?

318
00:15:47,354 --> 00:15:49,184
Where do you hear these rumors?

319
00:15:49,184 --> 00:15:54,024
I intend for him to work for us soon.

320
00:15:54,024 --> 00:15:56,064
May I have your permission for that, Your Majesty?

321
00:15:57,694 --> 00:15:59,944
I'll think about it.

322
00:16:03,994 --> 00:16:05,664
Are you all right?

323
00:16:05,664 --> 00:16:06,494
Yeah.

324
00:16:06,494 --> 00:16:08,164
Sorry, Lu.

325
00:16:08,164 --> 00:16:11,254
You were teamed up with Airi.

326
00:16:11,254 --> 00:16:12,624
You must be worried about her.

327
00:16:12,624 --> 00:16:15,384
She'll be fine. Noct is with her.

328
00:16:24,644 --> 00:16:26,224
What are those?

329
00:16:26,224 --> 00:16:28,184
This must be the production area.

330
00:16:28,184 --> 00:16:29,974
Is it producing Abysses?

331
00:16:29,974 --> 00:16:30,854
Yes.

332
00:16:30,854 --> 00:16:36,064
The Abysses produced here must be the ones that show up in various places.

333
00:16:37,614 --> 00:16:38,444
Phi!

334
00:16:39,404 --> 00:16:41,324
Something... is...

335
00:16:41,324 --> 00:16:41,784
Huh?

336
00:16:46,494 --> 00:16:51,044
Yes. Now is the time for
 the seed I sowed to sprout.

337
00:16:51,664 --> 00:16:53,004
Wh-What's that sound?!

338
00:16:59,384 --> 00:17:01,924
Phi, stay right there.

339
00:17:01,924 --> 00:17:03,344
I'll go check it out.

340
00:17:04,094 --> 00:17:05,474
No! Look out!

341
00:17:10,354 --> 00:17:12,064
Are you all right, Luxy?!

342
00:17:18,904 --> 00:17:19,904
Thanks.

343
00:17:32,294 --> 00:17:36,254
It must be like the one that
 attacked us at the sixth ruin.

344
00:17:36,254 --> 00:17:37,624
Lux, are you all right?

345
00:17:37,624 --> 00:17:42,344
Yes. We were just attacked by a
 large Abyss, but we're all unharmed.

346
00:17:42,344 --> 00:17:44,014
It's probably a Diablos.

347
00:17:44,014 --> 00:17:49,344
According to La Krulshe, when this ruin enters guard mode, three of them are released.

348
00:17:49,344 --> 00:17:50,224
Three of them?!

349
00:17:50,684 --> 00:17:56,984
Yes. Two roam the insides of the ruin,
 while one goes outside and attacks people.

350
00:17:58,314 --> 00:18:00,774
Headmistress! We should end today's expedition!

351
00:18:03,444 --> 00:18:05,494
No. We have to move forward.

352
00:18:06,404 --> 00:18:07,454
You can't be serious!

353
00:18:08,114 --> 00:18:12,534
Didn't you hear? This ruin went into guard mode
 and three Abysses were released!

354
00:18:12,994 --> 00:18:14,914
That's all the more reason to go forward.

355
00:18:15,334 --> 00:18:18,754
We're currently past the middle of level seven.

356
00:18:19,374 --> 00:18:21,384
We wouldn't make it out in time.

357
00:18:21,384 --> 00:18:22,794
It's too dangerous!

358
00:18:22,794 --> 00:18:24,094
Still, we're going!

359
00:18:24,094 --> 00:18:24,924
Huh?

360
00:18:32,304 --> 00:18:33,184
Phi!

361
00:18:33,184 --> 00:18:35,224
We have to hurry or the people of the island...

362
00:18:38,024 --> 00:18:38,854
Phi!

363
00:18:40,274 --> 00:18:41,484
I'm going after her!

364
00:18:41,484 --> 00:18:43,114
I assume that's fine by you, Headmistress?

365
00:18:46,324 --> 00:18:50,414
All right, Lux. Take care of Philuffy.

366
00:18:52,164 --> 00:18:54,334
Tillfur, I'm leaving the
 headmistress in your care.

367
00:18:54,334 --> 00:18:55,994
Got it! You can count on me!

368
00:19:06,594 --> 00:19:08,014
Are you all right, Phi?

369
00:19:08,804 --> 00:19:10,884
I'm fine, Lu.

370
00:19:10,884 --> 00:19:11,594
But...

371
00:19:11,594 --> 00:19:14,894
The Abyss went outside
 from somewhere up ahead.

372
00:19:14,894 --> 00:19:16,564
I can feel its presence.

373
00:19:17,644 --> 00:19:18,894
<i>Phi...</i>

374
00:19:24,404 --> 00:19:29,244
Say, Phi, have you maybe
 been to this island before?

375
00:19:40,124 --> 00:19:41,084
Phi?

376
00:19:45,094 --> 00:19:46,134
Lu!

377
00:19:56,354 --> 00:19:57,474
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

378
00:19:58,354 --> 00:20:00,934
<i>This place... This feeling...</i>

379
00:20:08,694 --> 00:20:10,444
<i>It couldn't be...</i>

380
00:20:10,444 --> 00:20:12,154
<i>Back then, Phi...</i>

381
00:20:35,934 --> 00:20:36,724
Phi!

382
00:20:45,904 --> 00:20:47,314
What is this place?

383
00:21:01,954 --> 00:21:03,414
<i>Yes, this is it.</i>

384
00:21:03,414 --> 00:21:04,714
<i>I remember this.</i>

385
00:21:08,594 --> 00:21:10,254
<i>In the days of the old empire,</i>

386
00:21:10,254 --> 00:21:13,724
<i>they did human experimentation here
 for the sake of developing new weapons.</i>

387
00:21:14,884 --> 00:21:18,684
<i>I came here five years ago.</i>

388
00:21:18,684 --> 00:21:19,144
<i>But...</i>

389
00:21:25,144 --> 00:21:26,904
<i>That can't be true.</i>

390
00:21:26,904 --> 00:21:30,114
<i>Back then Phi wasn't here.</i>

391
00:21:37,324 --> 00:21:38,454
Phi!

392
00:21:38,454 --> 00:21:39,824
Pull yourself together!

393
00:21:39,824 --> 00:21:42,044
I'll take you to the boarding house.

394
00:21:43,254 --> 00:21:44,454
You're burning up.

395
00:21:44,454 --> 00:21:45,794
No.

396
00:21:45,794 --> 00:21:47,544
There's an Abyss nearby.

397
00:21:47,544 --> 00:21:50,594
Relax. I already killed it.

398
00:21:50,594 --> 00:21:51,754
So don't worry.

399
00:21:53,714 --> 00:21:54,764
It's here.

400
00:21:58,844 --> 00:22:00,354
Phi...

